    "title": "Ola Electric Q2 Results: Revenue plunges 43% on sliding sales, loss narrows| Business News",
    "text": "Ola Electric Mobility Ltd. narrowed its losses in July-September 2025 even as revenue plunged 43%, amid fewer takers for electric two-wheelers.Consolidated net loss of the Bengaluru-based EV maker stood at ₹418 crore in the three months ended 30 September 2025, as against ₹495 crore loss in Q2 FY25, on revenue that fell 43.16% year-on-year to ₹690 crore, according to an exchange filing on Thursday.Ola Electric Q2 Results FY26 (Consolidated, YoY)Revenue down 43.16% at ₹690 croreNet loss at ₹418 crore vs ₹495 crore in Q2 FY25This is a developing story. More to come.",
